{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B3Gc5r2o8rrRKYSiJvPAA2","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# LEARNINGS — Runtime Discoveries\n     2→\n     3→### Learning: jackson-databind 2.9.11.1 does not exist\n     4→- Context: Initial pom.xml had `<jackson.version>2.9.11.1</jackson.version>`\n     5→- Discovery: Maven Central has no such artifact; the 2.9.x branch ends at 2.9.10.8\n     6→- Rule: Use `2.9.10.8` as the Jackson version for this project.\n     7→\n     8→### Learning: @JsonFormat inherits ObjectMapper timezone\n     9→- Context: Employee model uses `@JsonFormat(pattern = \"yyyy-MM-dd\")` without explicit timezone\n    10→- Discovery: Jackson defaults @JsonFormat without timezone to UTC, not the JVM local timezone. Tests creating dates with `Timestamp.valueOf(...)` (local TZ) would fail unless ObjectMapper is configured with `setTimeZone(TimeZone.getDefault())`\n    11→- Rule: Always call `objectMapper.setTimeZone(TimeZone.getDefault())` in tests (and in production WebConfig) when using @JsonFormat patterns that should reflect server local time.\n    12→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"246be9f5-fcf2-42eb-a23d-acfcd7a78b40","uuid":"5ba708f6-ec3b-402e-9f50-c571fc2a7b38","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/pinxbot/Desktop/ralph_loop/examples/asis-legacy/LEARNINGS.md","content":"# LEARNINGS — Runtime Discoveries\n\n### Learning: jackson-databind 2.9.11.1 does not exist\n- Context: Initial pom.xml had `<jackson.version>2.9.11.1</jackson.version>`\n- Discovery: Maven Central has no such artifact; the 2.9.x branch ends at 2.9.10.8\n- Rule: Use `2.9.10.8` as the Jackson version for this project.\n\n### Learning: @JsonFormat inherits ObjectMapper timezone\n- Context: Employee model uses `@JsonFormat(pattern = \"yyyy-MM-dd\")` without explicit timezone\n- Discovery: Jackson defaults @JsonFormat without timezone to UTC, not the JVM local timezone. Tests creating dates with `Timestamp.valueOf(...)` (local TZ) would fail unless ObjectMapper is configured with `setTimeZone(TimeZone.getDefault())`\n- Rule: Always call `objectMapper.setTimeZone(TimeZone.getDefault())` in tests (and in production WebConfig) when using @JsonFormat patterns that should reflect server local time.\n","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":12}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01B42Qmz1QALhQLEpCg67UZp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AHRjvz44A8nDzCqVRofnRp","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/pinxbot/Desktop/ralph_loop/examples/asis-legacy/LEARNINGS.md","old_string":"- Rule: Always call `objectMapper.setTimeZone(TimeZone.getDefault())` in tests (and in production WebConfig) when using @JsonFormat patterns that should reflect server local time.\n","new_string":"- Rule: Always call `objectMapper.setTimeZone(TimeZone.getDefault())` in tests (and in production WebConfig) when using @JsonFormat patterns that should reflect server local time.\n\n### Learning: javax.validation 1.1 lacks @NotBlank and @Email\n- Context: EmployeeRequest DTO needed @NotBlank and @Email annotations\n- Discovery: `javax.validation` 1.1.0.Final does not include `@NotBlank` or `@Email` (those were added in Bean Validation 2.0). Hibernate Validator 5.x provides them at `org.hibernate.validator.constraints.NotBlank` and `org.hibernate.validator.constraints.Email`.\n- Rule: For this project, use `org.hibernate.validator.constraints.NotBlank` and `org.hibernate.validator.constraints.Email`. Standard `javax.validation.constraints` annotations (@NotNull, @Size, @DecimalMin, etc.) work as normal.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":470,"cache_read_input_tokens":55777,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":470},"output_tokens":24,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"246be9f5-fcf2-42eb-a23d-acfcd7a78b40","uuid":"df5ef540-3eaf-46b1-8a5e-a602cde6dc49"}
